w kan zijn:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"AI interpreteert\n→ deterministische software valideert\n→ menselijke goedkeuring waar nodig\n→ systeem voert gecontroleerde actie uit"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"AI hoort niet vanzelfsprekend de eindbeslisser te zijn bij:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"geldberekeningen;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"factuurnummering;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"harde autorisatie;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"formele validatieregels;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"onveranderlijke statustransities."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"De vraag is dus niet of het platform \"AI heeft\", maar welke stap werkelijk baat heeft bij probabilistische interpretatie."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Drie voorbeeldscenario''s"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Scenario 1 — eenvoudige leadflow"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"websiteformulier\n→ CRM\n→ interne melding"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Kenmerken:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"bekende SaaS-systemen;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"beperkte mapping;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"laag risico;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"fouten handmatig her